\section{RIVM style characteristics (version 1.0)}{

The following design elements from the RIVM style guide are incorporated into \code{ro_gg_theme()}:
\itemize{
\item Background and Layout:
\itemize{
\item The background color for all plot elements is white.
\item The y-axis is hidden, while the x-axis is shown.
\item Major x-axis grid lines are hidden, major y-axis grid lines are shown, minor grid lines are hidden.
\item Titles (main, subtitle, caption, and facet) are aligned to the left of the plot area.
\item The x-axis title is aligned to the right of the plot area.
\item The legend is positioned at the bottom and aligned to the left of the plot area.
\item Margins around the plot have been increased to ensure all text elements have enough space.
}
\item Colors:
\itemize{
\item Titles (main, subtitle, legend, facet): \code{ro_color("donkerblauw")}
\item Caption: "#505050"
