\item Subtitle: \code{ro_color("donkerblauw")} and 1.17 × base_size.
\item Other titles: \code{ro_color(donkerblauw)} and 1.08 x base_size.
\item Caption: "#505050" and default base_size.
\item Legend text: \code{ro_color("grijs_7")} and 1.08 x base_size.
